R&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">: “</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">자퇴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">미등록</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">미복학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">미수강</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학사경고 누적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">”&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">등의 사유로 제적된 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 6pt; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-weight: bold; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 6pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold;\">자격 제한</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 41pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -41pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학생활동 등으로 제적된 자 중 개전의 정이 없는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학사경고로 제적된 후&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">이 경과되지 아니한 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학사경고제적&nbsp;</span><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">“</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">1</span></u><u