12pt;\">에 한하여 허가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학사운영규정에 의거</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">여석 초과 시 취득학점이 많은 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">평점평균이 높은 자 순으로 적용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">재입학은&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">제적 당시</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">의</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">학년</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">/</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">학부</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">과</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">전공</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">)</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">으로</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">허가</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">모집단위가 폐지된&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">의 경우 학칙이 정하는 모집단위로 재입학 허가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">재입학자가&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">기 취득한 학점 및 성적</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">은 그대로&nbsp;</span></u><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">인정</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학사경고 제적의 경우 당시 최종학기 학점 및 성적은 무효로 할 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 42.2pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -42.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">재입학 이전에 받은&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">“</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학사경고와 휴학기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">”</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">은 재입학 이후에 통산하지 않음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 33.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -33.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">재입학이 허가된 자는 지정된 기간 내에 등록금 납부 등 학적 절차를 이행하여야&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">,&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">이행하지 않을 경우 재입학 허가 취소 처리됨</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 38.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -38.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\">공학계열 재입학시 공학교육인증과정 변경방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 38.6pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 28.8px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -38.6pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">①&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: